<title>USA: BFS says majority holder approves merger.</title>
<headline>BFS says majority holder approves merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFS Bankorp Inc said on Tuesday that Fredric Gould, beneficial owner of about 55 percent of BFS's outstanding shares, had agreed to support the proposed merger with Dime Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Earlier on Tuesday, Dime announced a definitive agreement under which it would acquire BFS for a cash price of $52 per common share, or a total value of about $91.8 million.</p>
</text>
